{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24078","headline":"风雪中作 · 白居易","name":"风雪中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁暮风动地，夜寒雪连天。\n老夫何处宿，暖帐温炉前。\n两重褐绮衾，一领花茸毡。\n粥熟呼不起，日高安稳眠。\n是时心与身，了无闲事牵。\n以此度风雪，闲居来六年。\n忽思远游客，复想早朝士。\n蹋冻侵夜行，凌寒未明起。\n心爲身君父，身爲心臣子。\n不得身自由，皆爲心所使。\n我心既知足，我身自安止。\n方寸语形骸，吾应不负尔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}